OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after pedestrian struck by
OL,4,Acar that left road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in hospital after he sustained
OL,7,Fserious injuries when he was struck by
OL,8,Fa car that left the road in Leicester.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said a grey BMW 3
OL,11,FSeries came to rest on a foothpath and
OL,12,Finjured the pedestrian just after 22:35
OL,13,FGMT on Monday in Welford Place, Welford
OL,14,FRoad.
OL,16,FThe injured man is undergoing treatment
OL,17,Fin hospital, the force added.
OL,19,FA 21-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,21,Fdangerous driving, and remains in
OL,22,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
